    "introduction": "Ashley Louise Alfaro (née Urbanski; born March 14, 1992) is an American professional wrestler. She is signed to Major League Wrestling (MLW), where she performs under the ring name Shotzi Blackheart and is the reigning MLW World Women's Featherweight Champion. She also appears on the independent circuit, predominantly for Game Changer Wrestling (GCW). She is best known for her tenure in WWE, where she performed under the ring name Shotzi and is a former one-time NXT Women's Tag Team Champion.Prior to joining WWE, Alfaro performed for various promotions on the independent circuit, such as Shimmer Women Athletes, Evolve, Rise Wrestling, and Shine Wrestling, where she won the Shine Nova Championship.",
